  "body": "## Linux\n\n### amd64\n\n```shell\ncurl -L https://github.com/jenkins-x/jx/releases/download/v3.17.116/jx-linux-amd64.tar.gz | tar xzv\nsudo mv jx /usr/local/bin\n```\n\n### arm\n\n```shell\ncurl -L https://github.com/jenkins-x/jx/releases/download/v3.17.116/jx-linux-arm.tar.gz | tar xzv\nsudo mv jx /usr/local/bin\n```\n\n### arm64\n\n```shell\ncurl -L https://github.com/jenkins-x/jx/releases/download/v3.17.116/jx-linux-arm64.tar.gz | tar xzv\nsudo mv jx /usr/local/bin\n```\n\n## macOS\n\n### Using homebrew\n\n```shell\nbrew install --no-quarantine --cask jenkins-x/jx/jx\n```\n\n### Using curl\n\n#### amd64\n\n```shell\ncurl -L https://github.com/jenkins-x/jx/releases/download/v3.17.116/jx-darwin-amd64.tar.gz | tar xzv\nsudo mv jx /usr/local/bin\n```\n\n#### arm64\n\n```shell\ncurl -L https://github.com/jenkins-x/jx/releases/download/v3.17.116/jx-darwin-arm64.tar.gz | tar xzv\nsudo mv jx /usr/local/bin\n```\n## Changes in version 3.17.116\n\n### Chores\n\n* deps: bump anchore/sbom-action from 0.24.2 to 0.24.3 (dependabot[bot])\n"
